# Agreement Deadlines and Milestones

This scope computes key deadlines related to the agreement's entry into force, including the deadline for national information network reporting and the date for reviewing the agreement's functioning.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementMilestones:
  input entry_date content date
  input last_notification_date content date
  output info_deadline content date
  output review_date content date
  output effective_date content date
```

# Article 4 Deadline

Hungary must inform the Agency of its national information networks within three months of the agreement entering into force.

```catala
scope AgreementMilestones:
  date round down
  definition info_deadline equals entry_date + 3 month
```

# Article 15.1 Review Date

The parties must review the functioning of the agreement six months before the expiry of the third year from the entry into force.

```catala
scope AgreementMilestones:
  definition review_date equals (entry_date + 3 year) - 6 month
```

# Article 18 Entry into Force

The agreement enters into force on the first day of the second month following the date the last party delivers its notification of completion.

```catala
scope AgreementMilestones:
  definition effective_date equals last_notification_date + 2 month
```